/build/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# flock guards beside the files they protect. Deliberately not removed after
# unlocking: unlinking would let two processes create separate inodes and each
# believe it holds the lock. `tools/harvest` makes one beside its ledger.
*.lock

# Installed PDFs are built during deployment and are not tracked, so a local
# `make install` must not fill `git status` with two hundred untracked files.
# Reading-plan volumes and reviewed papal source readers are exceptions:
# their release records bind the installed bytes by digest.
/pdf/*
!/pdf/reading-plans/
!/pdf/papal-documents/
/pdf/papal-documents/*
!/pdf/papal-documents/*.pdf
